  6, 7 MH 199
  6–8  AA 484; CH 630
  7 FE 208; MB 15; MYP 73; 1T 32, 159; 2T 263; 3T 371; 6T 320; 7T 44; 8T 34
  8 CH 630; Ed 235; ML 5; MM 127; PP 460; TM 503, 505; 1T 574, 711; 2T 311,  317, 437; 4T 135; 5T 55
